Package: miadi-terminal
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python, tmux
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Clickable miadi-chronicle references in tmux on Termux
 A tap on a bare miadi-chronicle:126 in a tmux pane opens the episode in the
 Android browser. The Termux build of miadi-terminal: the opener and the tmux
 integration, relocated under Termux's prefix. The Miadi server resolves the
 reference; nothing is resolved on the phone. Run `miadi-terminal enable`
 and `miadi-terminal front https://<your Miadi>` once.
